  "notes": "## 0.9.0-alpha.5 - 2026-05-13\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a separate privacy switch for usage analytics, so diagnostics and product usage statistics can be controlled independently.\n- Improve mobile sync compatibility with Android clients, including clipboard history access and image or file uploads.\n- Add an Ask AI chat to the documentation site so users can find UniClipboard help more quickly.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make device pairing more reliable on Tailscale and other overlay networks.\n- Restore the saved interface scale as soon as the app starts, so zoom shortcuts stay in sync after a restart.\n- Make the Linux main window layout fit the system title bar more cleanly.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.9.0-alpha.5 - 2026-05-13\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增单独的使用情况分析隐私开关，诊断数据和产品使用统计可以分别控制。\n- 改进移动同步对 Android 客户端的兼容性，包括剪贴板历史访问以及图片或文件上传。\n- 文档站新增 AI 问答，用户可以更快找到 UniClipboard 的使用帮助。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 提升在 Tailscale 和其他覆盖网络上的设备配对可靠性。\n- 应用启动时会立即恢复已保存的界面缩放，重启后的缩放快捷键也会保持同步。\n- Linux 主窗口布局现在能更自然地适配系统标题栏。",
